	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0901_mission_add_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かぞくは　かえられない
だから　つきあいかたを　かえるの▼
そう　いわれても　なかなか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:56:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T01:19:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>家族は　替えられない
だから　つきあいかたを　変えるの▼
そう　いわれても　なかなか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:56:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T01:19:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・メロエッタイベント前
　一言メッセージ
※swan新規</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:49:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:49:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0901_mission_add_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うまれこきょう……
おさないころ……▼
きのみあつめを　おえて
みんなで　うたっていたのを▽
おもいだしちゃったよ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:54:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T01:24:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>生まれ故郷……
幼いころ……▼
きのみあつめを　終えて
みんなで　歌っていたのを▽
思い出しちゃったよ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:55:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T01:24:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メロエッタイベント・いにしえのうたを歌った後
　続けてmission_add_03へ
※swan新規</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:49:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T05:49:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0901_mission_add_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハイリンクに　フェスミッションの
『[Name:FesMissionName ]』が▽
ついか　されました！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T06:06:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
